== speed buffs while skills scale off attack ==
one window of 1000000 action value, so turns equal speed
terms                         speed   turns   attack   per turn      total    gain
unbuffed                          80      80      480        370      29600   1.00x
speed +50%                       117     117      480        370      43290   1.46x
attack +50%                       80      80      693        534      42720   1.44x
both +50%                        117     117      693        534      62478   2.11x
speed -30%                        62      62      480        370      22940   0.77x
a percentage of speed and the same percentage of attack are worth the same output:
one multiplies turns, the other multiplies damage

== speed as a damage stat ==
an attack scaling skill at 1800 per mille against a speed scaling one at 9600,
chosen so a 150 speed, 800 attack duelist hits for the same amount with either

unit                     speed  attack   turns   attack skill   speed skill
swift                      200     760     200         117200        164400
slow                        80     480      80          29600         26320
swift over slow                                         3.95x         6.24x

what a +50% speed buff is worth to the slow unit on a speed scaling skill
scaling source                          turns   per turn      total    gain
current                                    117        481      56277   2.13x
base                                       117        329      38493   1.46x
a skill declares which it reads: the current stat accepts the compounding,
the base stat lets the buff move the turn economy only

